Z||000000||Haze_Performance||08-29-2001||11:01 PM||||<B>Fierorama 2001 is set to go for Sunday Sept. 9th, 2001 in Oak Brook, IL!<BR>(Located about 18 miles due East from downtown Chicago, just off I-88).<BR>Registration is from 10:30-1:00PM. Participant and guest voting is from<BR>1:30-3:00PM, Awards, raffles, door prize drawings, and a Fiero auction<BR>starts at 4PM. The raffle tickets  for the 88GT, Mr. Mikes interior & Fiero<BR>Store gift certificate will be the last items to be drawn. Everything will<BR>be done by 5PM! Rodney Dickman will be there with his Fiero Accessories, V8<BR>Archie with at least 2 cars, Bob Steiger from Twin Lakes Fiero, DJ music,<BR>and a lot of nice Fieros!<BR>Registration is free for NIFE members, $10.00 for non-members. You can<BR>register on line and get driving information at: <A HREF="http://www.fierofocus.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fierofocus.com</A> <BR>(Non-members can pay the $10.00 registration on the 9th).</B><P><I>Message from Paul Vargyas<BR>Northern Illinois Fiero Enthusiasts</I><P><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">          <BR></A>||||reg||10
